  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[Song Title: Margin of Error]\r\n[Style: breakbeat, math rock, chopped Amen-style drum breaks, glitchy percussion edits, interlocking clean electric guitars with tapping, syncopated bass stabs, granular synth textures, sidechain compression, clean studio recording, expressive male lead]\r\n[Caption: Trust oscillates between signal and noise.]\r\n[Image: A waveform splitting into jagged fragments over a fractured grid.]\r\n[Refresh Title: Random 3]\r\n[Theme: Random]\r\n[Gradients: 3]\r\n[Rank: 17]\r\n[Title Rarity: 1.58]\r\n[Tempo Lock BPM: 142]\r\n[Created: 2026-03-01]\r\n[Seeds: 884, A:53, B:1, C:73, D:43]\r\n[Perspective: i_reflect]\r\n[Concept: In a world of probabilistic errors and broken signals, trust is a fragile proof we try to verify.]\r\n[Topic: Complexity & Emergence → order_from_noise]\r\n[Genre Bias: breakbeat (→ math rock)]\r\n[Style Change: Bridge]\r\n[Modulation: none]\r\n[Hook Prominence: medium]\r\n[Deviation: instrumental_break before final chorus]\r\n[Visual Mood: tense]\r\n[Visual Motion: high]\r\n[Visual Density: dense]\r\n[Visual Lyric Presence: auto]\r\n[Visual Color Bias: cool]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.8]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[chopped drum break stuttering in 13/8 then snapping to 4/4]\r\n[guitar harmonics outlining diminished intervals]\r\n[sub bass pulses on irregular accents]\r\n[glitch textures pan left to right in microbursts]\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Visual: scene=hold; motion=high; density=normal; focus=rhythm]\r\n[angular melody with clipped phrasing and abrupt rests]\r\nI measure truth in decimal dust  \r\nRounding off the edges of trust  \r\nError bars around each claim  \r\nConfidence without a name  \r\n\r\n[Pre-Chorus]\r\n[rising chromatic line over half-time drums]\r\nEvery promise quantified  \r\nStandard deviance inside  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Visual: scene=lift; motion=high; density=dense; focus=vocal]\r\n[wide-interval hook landing hard on offbeats]\r\nMargin of error, wide as a lie  \r\nSignal is clean but the data will cry  \r\nTrust is a theorem we try to defend  \r\nProof in the middle that breaks at the end  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[melody drops to lower register with syncopated bass counterpoint]\r\nFeedback loops in hidden code  \r\nBias on a heavy load  \r\nRandom noise across the wire  \r\nTruth compressed in sampled fire  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Visual: scene=contrast; motion=medium; density=sparse; focus=texture]\r\n[Style Change: guitars thin out, breakbeat fractures into granular clicks]\r\n[sustained vocal notes over shifting polyrhythms]\r\nIf I flip the coin enough  \r\nHeads feels honest, tails feels rough  \r\nYet both obey the silent law  \r\nChance and pattern interlock  \r\n\r\n[Instrumental Break]\r\n[instrumental_break mutation — drums solo with sliced fills]\r\n[tapping guitar motif in 7/8 over steady 4/4 kick]\r\n[bass slides through tritone tension]\r\n[noise sweep builds toward re-entry]\r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[hook restated with added harmony and doubled guitars]\r\nMargin of error, drawn in red  \r\nFacts we trust and lies we spread  \r\nBetween the doubt and what we know  \r\nDeterministic undertow  \r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[hook_echo]\r\nMargin of error",
